Help. The road of levels for your side, in order: the first two are open, and each next one opens when one of the two before it is won; a locked one says what else it needs (the long bridge: the bridge troll). Arrows: choose. Enter, space, its number or a click on it: go there. B, Backspace or Esc: back. Menu bar: H home, D hall of deeds, S settings, ? help, Q leave (or click it). Any key or a click closes this.
